OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FIt will be a mainly chilly and
OL,6,Fbright start, but cloudy over the
OL,7,Feastern Borders, perhaps some light
OL,8,Frain. Staying mainly dry and bright
OL,9,Fwith sunny spells. Light north or
OL,10,Fnorthwest winds.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FDry and often clear this
OL,13,Fevening and overnight, turning chilly
OL,14,Fwith a touch of frost in places. The
OL,15,Fodd mist and fog patch also possible.
OL,16,
OL,17,CMonday:FMainly dry and bright with
OL,18,Foccasional sunny breaks. Cloudier at
OL,19,Ftimes through the Lothians and Borders
OL,20,Fwith isolated showers. Winds will be
OL,21,Flight and variable.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
