OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:FPlenty
OL,6,Fdry and settled weather under an area
OL,7,Fof high pressure. Mostly cloudy in the
OL,8,Feast, patchy light rain possible, best
OL,9,Fof any clear or sunny spells in the
OL,10,Fwest.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
